      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Cartecay River winds through East Ellijay, cutting a valley that defines the town’s southern border with the Chattahoochee National Forest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Ellijay%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Georgia State Route 5/515, a four‑lane bypass, snakes north‑south through East Ellijay, linking the town to the wider region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Ellijay%2C_Georgia",
